OL,3,AEx-gang boss sentenced to 40 years for
OL,4,Aorchestrating Tupac Shakur's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer gang boss Duane "Keffe D" Davis
OL,7,Fhas been sentenced to 40 years in
OL,8,Fprison for orchestrating the murder of
OL,9,FTupac Shakur.
OL,11,FA jury found Davis guilty in September
OL,12,Fof one count of murder with a deadly
OL,13,Fweapon for the rap superstar's death in
OL,14,Fa drive-by shooting in Las Vegas on 7
OL,15,FSeptember 1996. He has said he will
OL,16,Fappeal the verdict.
OL,18,FThe 63-year-old gang boss' conviction
OL,19,Fwas the first in a cold case that has
OL,20,Fintrigued hip-hop fans for nearly 30
OL,21,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
