OL,3,AEx-gang boss sentenced to 40 years for
OL,4,Aorchestrating Tupac Shakur's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors argued that although Davis
OL,7,Fdid not fire the gun himself, he was
OL,8,Fthe ringleader of the group that
OL,9,Fcommitted the murder. He admitted in
OL,10,Fhis memoir that he had provided the gun
OL,11,Fused in the crime.
